397	     *  late charge) frozen now. Refused (409) unless PENDING, (403) for a clerk or the user who
398	     *  opened it, (423) when it is dated in a closed period, and (422) when its due is above the
399	     *  proof threshold in force on its date while it has no proof. */
400	    @Transactional
